ontent": "Example: I don't have time to exercise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le01ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Verb to be in Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To ask questions with the verb to be, you change the order of the subject and the verb. There is no short form.  The answer to these questions is always Yes or No."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"italic\">Am I in this class?<br/> Are you a new student?<br/> Is he your brother?<br/ Are they from Australia?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"5\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Verb to be</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Subject</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Am\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I...?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"you...?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he...?<br/>she...?<br/>it...?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"we...?<br/>they...?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Verb to be - Negative"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "To make the negative form of the verb <span class = \"strong\">to be</span>, you put the word not after the verb. Sometimes there are two short forms."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"4\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Long Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"s